[292.047316, "o", "  \u001b[36m●\u001b[0m \u001b[1mBash\u001b[0m \u001b[2mcd /demo/Alloy; opticli search \"Alloy Track whitepaper\" --in strings --limit 200; echo; opticli search \"Partners\" --in names --li\u001b[2m…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[296.047316, "o", "  \u001b[36m●\u001b[0m \u001b[1mBash\u001b[0m \u001b[2mcd /demo/Alloy; opticli where-used 8 --pages --limit 200; echo; opticli access 128; echo; opticli tree 128 --depth 3\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[300.047316, "o", "  \u001b[36m●\u001b[0m \u001b[1mBash\u001b[0m \u001b[2mcd /demo/Alloy; opticli get 127; echo; opticli get 9 --fields MainContentArea; echo; opticli versions 9 --limit 3; echo; opticli \u001b[2m…\u001b[0m\r\n"]
[304.047316, "o", "\r\n"]
[304.047372, "o", "  **Pages that promote the whitepaper** (`/en/alloy-track/download-whitepaper-alloy-track/`, ref 8). Two published pages link to it:\r\n  \r\n  - **Alloy Track** (`/en/alloy-track/`) has the whitepaper page directly in its MainContentArea, shown full width. That's been live since 2021.\r\n"]
[304.047575, "o", "  - **Alloy Meet** (`/en/alloy-meet/`) shows it through the new teaser block \"Alloy Track whitepaper teaser\" (ref 127, headed \"Plan less, ship more\"). The\r\n    block and the page version that holds it (9_149) were both published today at 12:41 UTC by the `opticli` user.\r\n  \r\n"]
[304.047641, "o", "  **Who can read the Partners section** (`/en/partners/`, ref 128): only signed-in users. Its access rights are set on the page itself rather than inherited:\r\n  - **Authenticated** users can read it.\r\n  - **Administrators** have full access.\r\n  - Everyone isn't listed, so anonymous visitors can't see it.\r\n"]
[304.047673, "o", "  \r\n  Its one subpage, **Partner training** (`/en/partners/partner-training/`), gets the same rights from Partners.\r\n"]
[308.047673, "o", "\u001b[32m\u001b[1m/demo/Alloy\u001b[0m \u001b[36m❯\u001b[0m o"]
